WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Adding someone to Quickler takes seconds.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.300
All you need is their name and their phone number.

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.580
There's no app for them to download and no password to remember.

4
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:12.120
When the time comes to do a Check, they need only ask Quickler for it.
